Joinery
Copyright (c) 2026 Joe Gaudet. MIT licensed; see LICENSE.md.

Joinery ports the design, styles, component APIs and examples of shadcn/ui, and provides the
features of ember-primitives. Its Toast ports sonner, which shadcn/ui's Sonner wraps: sonner's
toast state, its Toaster and Toast, and its icons and loader, in @ember-joinery/primitives'
toast, and sonner's style sheet, copied unchanged into @ember-joinery/ember's compiled CSS.
Its charts, @ember-joinery/chart, port recharts, which shadcn/ui's Chart wraps: recharts' tick
selection (getTicks, getEquidistantTicks), nice tick values (getNiceTickValues), text
measurement (DOMUtils' getStringSize), cartesian layout (the plot area, scales, stacking, bar
positions, tick lines), pie layout (computePieSectors, the pie's labels, polar label positions,
inRangeOfSector), polar layout (PolarUtils, the radar's points, the radial bars' sectors, the
polar grid, axes and labels) and tooltip placement (getTooltipTranslateXY), and its rectangle,
sector and polygon paths (getRectanglePath, Sector, getSectorPath, Polygon). Its Drawer ports
vaul, which shadcn/ui's Drawer is built on: vaul's behaviour in @ember-joinery/primitives' drawer,
and vaul's style sheet, copied into @ember-joinery/ember's compiled CSS. Its Command ports cmdk,
which shadcn/ui's Command is built on: cmdk's behaviour and its command score, in
@ember-joinery/primitives' command. Its Calendar ports React DayPicker, which shadcn/ui's Calendar
is built on: DayPicker's markup, classes, labels, selection and keyboard, in
@ember-joinery/primitives' calendar. Its opt-in file uploads, @ember-joinery/file-upload, are
built on ember-file-upload, and its opt-in rich-text editor, @ember-joinery/tiptap, on Tiptap,
each a dependency of its package (nothing of either is ported). All of them are MIT licensed;
their notices and licences follow.

